{"id":"n63350-1-8","stage":5,"title":"새삼스럽다 · (记忆)犹新","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63350-1-8-1","ko":"매일 마시던 평범한 커피인데 오늘은 새삼스럽게 맛있네.","zh":"本来就是每天喝的普通咖啡，今天却莫名地觉得好喝啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"天天，每日","explanation":"매일：天天，每日","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58104","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시던","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평범한","meaning":"平凡，一般","explanation":"평범하다：平凡，一般；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"평범하다","audio":"/audio/f4453bb3f80b58658a02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71336","senseId":"1","lemma":"평범하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피인데","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"1","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새삼스럽게","meaning":"(记忆)犹新，重新，全新","explanation":"새삼스럽다：(记忆)犹新，重新，全新；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새삼스럽다","audio":"/audio/9cd881d3b48e4d2637c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63350","senseId":"1","lemma":"새삼스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있네.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"天天，每日","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58104","definition":"每天都，无遗漏地。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"f4453bb3f80b5865","term":"평범하다","zh":"平凡，一般","audio":"/audio/f4453bb3f80b58658a02.mp3","entryId":"71336","definition":"没有突出或特别之处，非常普通。","pronunciation":["평범하다"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"炒熟制成粉后，放入沸水中喝的咖啡树果实；或指其粉末。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"9cd881d3b48e4d26","term":"새삼스럽다","zh":"(记忆)犹新，重新，全新","audio":"/audio/9cd881d3b48e4d2637c9.mp3","entryId":"63350","definition":"对已经感觉到或知道的东西再次产生新的感情。","pronunciation":["새삼스럽따"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c016a7b4379c478be3d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63350-1-8-2","ko":"기분 좋은 일이 있나 봐요.","zh":"看来是发生了什么开心的事吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기분","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/646dd3dbc6c7a71589cf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.385,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63350","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是发生了什么开心的事吧。","这是我自己亲手做的包，送给您当礼物吧。","本来就是每天喝的普通咖啡，今天却莫名地觉得好喝啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是发生了什么开心的事吧。","本来就是每天喝的普通咖啡，今天却莫名地觉得好喝啊。","这是我自己亲手做的包，送给您当礼物吧。"],"answer":0}]}
